Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20requireAdminAuth=20async=20=E2=80=94=20s?=
 =?UTF-8?q?eletor=20filial=20gerado=20antes=20de=20next()=20com=20timeout?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=202s?=
